00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:44.680
They wanted me nowhere near that thing.

484
00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.600
They were like, hey, big pregnant lady, you're already freaking us out.

485
00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:48.460
Stay away.

486
00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:53.640
I remember talking to Jen Salotta about it and she said, oh my gosh, all the writers were

