00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:56.400
They're like, we're going to ride the Ferris wheel.

489
00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:57.620
It's going to be so fun.

490
00:21:57.860 --> 00:21:59.840
And then none of them ever rode it.

491
00:22:00.180 --> 00:22:00.540
No.

492
00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:04.660
I remember when they had the bouncy houses, whenever we had a bouncy house, you know,

493
00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:06.800
there'd be someone to be like, oh, could the kids come by today?

494
00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:07.440
They're like, nope.

495
00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:09.780
No one get on those things.

496
00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.740
Well, two people who were allowed to get on the Ferris wheel.

497
00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:15.860
I remember when they shot this, Angela, these poor guys.

