00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:21.780
Just as a person who rode the Jurassic Park ride for 12 hours,

500
00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:23.840
you know how old it gets.

501
00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:25.500
It's a trigger for you.

502
00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:25.920
It is.

503
00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:26.340
It's a trigger.

504
00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:29.320
And I watched them ride that Ferris wheel for about an hour.

505
00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:31.960
I don't understand how they weren't completely sick.

506
00:22:32.140 --> 00:22:36.580
When you watch the episode, you see one scene between Michael and Holly on the Ferris wheel,

507
00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:37.240
but there are more.

508
00:22:37.420 --> 00:22:40.040
And they're in the deleted scenes and they're really cute.

509
00:22:40.060 --> 00:22:41.680
So they were in there for a while.

510
00:22:42.100 --> 00:22:43.360
Yeah, I remember that.

